cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Neuron ASD, please cite both the software (this file) and the accompanying paper."
title: "Neuron ASD"
abstract: >-
  An open platform for exploring the predicted effects of receptor
  agonist/inhibitor modulations toward a typically-developing profile
  from EEG in autism. Neuron ASD places each subject on the
  excitation/inhibition axis relative to a typically-developing
  reference and reports the receptor modulation predicted to move that
  subject's spectral profile toward the reference.
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-24
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/arianadelg/neuron-asd-tool"
url: "https://github.com/arianadelg/neuron-asd-tool"
keywords:
  - autism spectrum disorder
  - excitation-inhibition balance
  - EEG
  - aperiodic exponent
  - neural mass model
  - computational psychiatry
  - in silico screening
